@startuml clam-state-machine
title CLAM Closed Loop State Machine

[*] --> designed
designed --> validated : POST /state\ntargetState=validated
validated --> published : POST /state\ntargetState=published
published --> active : POST /state\ntargetState=active
active --> paused : POST /state\ntargetState=paused
active --> error : POST /state\ntargetState=error
paused --> active : POST /state\ntargetState=active
paused --> retired : POST /state\ntargetState=retired
error --> active : POST /state\ntargetState=active
error --> retired : POST /state\ntargetState=retired
designed --> retired : POST /state\ntargetState=retired
validated --> retired : POST /state\ntargetState=retired
published --> retired : POST /state\ntargetState=retired
retired --> [*]

@enduml